{
  "_comment": [
    "Maps the folder names under missions/ to Arma world class names, which is what",
    "the mission folder suffix must be (MissionName.WorldClass).",
    "",
    "A folder whose own name already carries a suffix (small.Enoch) needs no entry —",
    "use-map.js reads the suffix directly. Everything else is looked up here; if a map",
    "is missing, use-map.js falls back to the folder name and says so.",
    "",
    "'mod' is a hint about what must be loaded for the world to exist. Vanilla worlds",
    "have no mod. Correct any entry that turns out wrong — a wrong world class shows up",
    "as the mission simply not appearing in the server browser."
  ],

